The native transport links the OpenAI Codex SDK at commit
740e5af33c71225640e0c1c1555c514c2c93ab74, released as
rust-v0.162.0-alpha.17.2, under its Apache-2.0 license.

The build adds raw outgoing JSON envelopes and an optional server name to the
SDK transport in a private build checkout. SDK license and notice files must
accompany distributed relay binaries. The gateway's relay implementation is MIT.
